Subject: [PATCH 13/18] usbip: Pass session keys to the kernel
X-SA-Exim-Version: 4.2.1 (built Mon, 26 Dec 2011 16:24:06 +0000)
X-SA-Exim-Scanned: Yes (on vidar.hosts.sieglitzhof.net)
